		"description": "<p>While you are Soul Touched, the first weapon Attack you make each turn for the duration deals bonus damage equal to your soul power.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Use this feature while you are Soul Touched: it gives you the “I am Soul Touched” effect, and weapon attacks add your soul power to their damage. Remove it from your Effects tab when the mark ends (it also ends with the encounter or a rest).</em></p><p><em>[M] Only the first weapon Attack each turn should get the bonus — remove the extra dice from later attacks that turn.</em></p>",
